// # Port State — Lazy Incremental Engine Union
//
// Logline: One struct holding every scene engine's live state so runtime
// preview advances scenes lazily instead of replaying a pre-rendered tape.
// Setup: Pure state. Inactive engines are constructed on empty line input so
// a session pays only for the scene it actually runs; each engine's pcs/fin
// fields carry the latest step result.
// Beats:
//   1. port_state_new builds all 51 engine states once per session.
//   2. port_arcade_steps encodes the Rust ScenePace::Arcade tempo table.

